<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Renaissance Energy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Renaissance Energy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Renaissance Energy Ltd and added the stock to the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- said had the stock as a market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
